 {
  "source": "Morgan Stanley",
  "title": "From Friction to Function: AI and Mortgage Markets",
  "type": "strategy",
  "priority": "high",
  "published": "2026-07-17",
  "insights": [
   "AI adoption by borrowers is an underappreciated catalyst that could significantly increase mortgage refinancing volumes by reducing friction in awareness, shopping, and documentation.",
